OL,3,GNEWSANationalist residents' groups warn
OL,4,Asome parading settlements 'could
OL,5,Aunravel' over Drumcree
OL,6,
OL,7,FAlmost a dozen nationalist residents'
OL,8,Fgroups have warned some parading
OL,9,Fsettlements "could unravel" if the
OL,10,FOrange Order insists on marching down
OL,11,Fthe Garvaghy Road in Portadown.
OL,13,FThe order has applied to march on
OL,14,FSunday.
OL,16,FThe Drumcree parade as it is known, has
OL,17,Fbeen banned from the mainly-nationalist
OL,18,FGarvaghy Road since 1998.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
