OL,3,GNEWSANationalist residents' groups warn
OL,4,Asome parading settlements 'could
OL,5,Aunravel' over Drumcree
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhile the Parades Commission considers
OL,8,Fthe application, 11 residents' groups
OL,9,Ffrom across Northern Ireland have
OL,10,Fexpressed solidarity with Garvaghy Road
OL,11,Fresidents.
